<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "take a body onto the shelf, moving it by default, --keep to copy"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///library.body.acquires", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/library.body.acquires"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/library.body.acquires"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! library.body.acquires ~ a body a human did not author comes onto the shelf

`lares library acquire <file> to=<collection>` digests the file and lands it at `<library>/<collection>/<cid>/<the real filename>`, recording its entry in the collection's index slot. It moves the source by default, since moving keeps the body off every tracked tree; `--keep` copies. `--origin`, `--licence` (or `--license`) and `--note` ride the entry. The same bytes already on the shelf answer held.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ acquire · keep

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`acquire` params=`file/book.epub to/mark-twain origin/https://example.org/book licence/public-domain ~ move a body onto the shelf with its provenance`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`keep` params=`file/book.epub to/mark-twain keep/true ~ copy, and leave the source where it stood`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ file · to · origin · licence · license · note · keep

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<file> ~ the file to acquire`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`to` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the collection it joins`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`origin` params=`takes/words ~ where the body came from`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`licence` params=`takes/words ~ the licence it travels under`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`license` params=`takes/words ~ the same licence, the other spelling`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`note` params=`takes/words ~ a note on the entry`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`keep` params=`~ copy the body and leave the source standing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/hand ~ moves a host file into this host's own library home; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[library.body.acquires file/book.epub to/mark-twain]] ~ no file, no --to, or no such file on the host`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the shelf could not take the body; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ acquired

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`acquired` params=`exit/0 fields/[[held moved path meta]] ~ the body stands on the shelf; held where the same bytes already stood`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares library acquire

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares library acquire]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

